        <mxCell id="transfer-rules" value="State After Transfer&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A transfer does not automatically cancel an existing highest bid. The bidder may still withdraw it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The new holder may accept a valid bid, or approve the market and create a new listing.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A contract recipient must support safe ERC-721 receipt." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#162b42;strokeWidth=1.6;shape=note;size=18;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#f6f8fb;strokeColor=#c5d1df;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;" vertex="1" parent="1">
